	(text "GP6 high = the NPN conducts = the Melzi pin low = OK. A touch, a dead\nMCU (100k holds the base low) or a cut wire: the Melzi's pull-up\n(R401, sheet Melzi) wins = triggered."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 317.5 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "56f375eb-5604-4adf-9457-de8e46dcab8e")
	)
	(text "POWER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c0f83e06-c81b-453e-a93e-f43b4faa9611")
	)
	(text "The board: USB from the Pi (its 3V3 = +3V3_PH, the bridge's E+).\nThe tool: MP_Buck1 (+5V_BUCK1) through U953 and F951 to\n+5V_TOOL. Grounds: the one star point; R960 on the ON line."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a74b91be-8f1b-49bc-9a4c-a7b34d380040")
	)
	(text "THE BRIDGE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0b832e61-0b83-4d00-a445-d2da026346a6")
	)
	(text "One full bridge, closed on the pads on HS: orange = E, blue = S.\nGreen: the tool's ID + the QRE's output, brown: the QRE's 3V3/GND.\nSign and grams on the bench; diag() noise with a tool going on and off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a6a33006-7c4e-41f7-b9b7-750d4c10b58d")
	)
	(text "THE ADC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2eaed6dd-0df2-4242-814d-d950b58d71bc")
	)
	(text "The plot bed board's sum chip: AIN0-AIN1, 330/s, DRDY2 = the touch IRQ.\nRatiometric: REFP0/REFN0 on the 3V3 that feeds E+.\nThe feet chip (CS1/DRDY1) is not fitted: firmware reports it missing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0671cae3-129c-4e4f-ae37-dac61721b90d")
	)
	(text "THE TOOL"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 288.29 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7385064d-b198-46a7-afc5-e6116fd6e76c")
	)
	(text "GP26: the ID (later the link), GP27: its pull-up, GP9:\nthe tool's 5 V, GP28: the QRE (tool seated, any tool with\na white label). Data pins inputs until the tool has 5 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 288.29 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4c93405f-a7df-4a27-a15c-4f43de81d565")
	)
